<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 210-2 IN 1ST INNINGS V EASTERN PROVINCE - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 210-2 IN 1ST INNINGS V EASTERN PROVINCE - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were</p>
<p>210 for two at the close on the opening day of their three-day</p>
<p>match against Eastern Province at St Georges Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Rain stopped play shortly after tea with 34.2 overs still to</p>
<p>be bowled</p>
</text>
